          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "if(@transparentBg, transparent, @bgColor)",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "padding": "2.25rem",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-card-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list05\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentBg\" checked>\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Често Задавани Въпроси</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h1 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>Какво прави базата уникална?</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Базата съчетава девствена природа, гора и златист плаж, предлагайки уникално изживяване.</i></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h1 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>Подходящо ли е времето за плуване?</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Да, мекият климат прави водата подходяща за къпане от юни до октомври.</i></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h1 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>Какви са условията за настаняване?</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Предлагаме самостоятелни бунгала сред дървета, осигуряващи комфорт и уединение. Има кабелна телевизия&nbsp; и&nbsp; безжичен интернет.</i></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                  <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                      <h1 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                          <b>Има ли паркинг?</b></h1>\n                      <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Да, базата разполага със собствен паркинг за удобство на гостите.</i></p>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                        <b>Какви забележителности има в района?</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Ахтопол е един от най-старите градове на западното крайбрежие на Черно море.\n<br>Основан е много преди Аполония, Месамбрия и Анхиало като главен град на тракийското племе Тини.\n<br>Преживява властта на Александър Македонски, на Римската, Византийската и Османската империи.\n<br>Многократно е разрушаван и възстановяван и от 1913г е в пределите на българската държава.</i><br><i>\n<br>Запазените действащи исторически паметници в гр. Ахтопол, които може да посетите са: част от крепостната стена, църквата “Възнесение Господне“, Гръцкото училище, Стара гръцка къща.</i><br><i><br>Ако желаете да разнообразите почивката си можете да посетите и други\n<br>плажове, намиращи се в близост до гр. Ахтопол: плажа до устието на река Велека, плажовете Бутамята, Силистар, дивия плаж Липите, Листи в Синеморец.</i><br><i>\n<br>Също така може да осъществите една чудесна разходка с кану по река Велека, където ще имате възможност да се полюбувате на жълтите лилии, растящи край бреговете на реката и да видите колонии от водни костенурки.</i><br><i>\n<br>Заслужава си да посетите и историческия музей в гр. Царево, където са изложени\n<br>сребърни и златни накити, открити при разкопки в с. Синеморец в един от най-богатите гробове от периода на елинизма в Европа.&nbsp;</i><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_name": "list05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_cid": "vcwhERZhLh",
          "_anchor": "faq",
          "alias": false,
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".social-row": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              ".soc-item": {
                "margin": "8px",
                "a": {
                  "&:hover, &:focus": {
                    ".mbr-iconfont": {
                      "background-color": "@active"
                    }
                  },
                  ".mbr-iconfont": {
                    "width": "72px",
                    "height": "72px",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "border-radius": "100%",
                    "font-size": "32px",
                    "background-color": "@iconBg",
                    "color": "@icon",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".row-links": {
              "width": "100%",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .social-list": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"social05\" group=\"Social\" global mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <header>Social</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSoc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Icons Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#393193\" name=\"icon\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" condition=\"showSoc\" name=\"active\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" name=\"iconBg\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title align-center mb-5 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .social-list\">\n                <b>Следвайте ни</b>\n            </h3>\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"social-row\" mbr-if=\"showSoc\">\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/%D0%91%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0-%D0%AE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD-%D0%91%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B3-61579257609845/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-facebook socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html#Home\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-twitter socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html#Home\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html#Home\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 4\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html#Home\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-twitch socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_name": "social05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_cid": "vcwhERZVYc",
          "_anchor": "follow-us",
          "alias": false,
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "if(@transparentBg, transparent, @bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".main-button": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".google-map": {
              "height": "30rem",
              "position": "relative",
              "border-radius": "2rem",
              "iframe": {
                "height": "100%",
                "width": "100%",
                "border-radius": "2rem"
              },
              "[data-state-details]": {
                "color": "#6b6763",
                "height": "1.5em",
                "margin-top": "-0.75em",
                "padding-left": "1.25rem",
                "padding-right": "1.25rem",
                "position": "absolute",
                "text-align": "center",
                "top": "50%",
                "width": "100%"
              },
              "&[data-state]": {
                "background": "#e9e5dc"
              },
              "&[data-state=\"loading\"]": {
                "[data-state-details]": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"contacts03\" group=\"Contact\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Map</header>\n    <input type=\"map\" title=\"Map\" name=\"googleMap\" place-id=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m12!1m3!1d172.9195444160141!2d27.926774653730277!3d42.09911780160242!2m3!1f0!2f6.033889430109706!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f59.79125624651978!5e1!3m2!1sbg!2sus!4v1772751849175!5m2!1sbg!2sus&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\" value=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m12!1m3!1d172.9195444160141!2d27.926774653730277!3d42.09911780160242!2m3!1f0!2f6.033889430109706!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f59.79125624651978!5e1!3m2!1sbg!2sus!4v1772751849175!5m2!1sbg!2sus&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentBg\" condition=\"bg.type === 'color'\" checked>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n            <b><i>Резервации и контакти</i></b></h5>\n          <p class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><i>Резервирайте и се потопете в лятното настроение на гр. Ахтопол!</i><br>\n<br><b>Резервации са възможни единствено на телефон - 0884 112 129</b><br>\n<br><i>Резервацията се счита за потвърдена при превод на депозит от 25% от цялата сума.</i><br>\n<br><b>Реновирани бунгала:</b><br><i>до 4 човека 74 евро / 144.73 лв. на вечер за бунгало\n<br>за 5 човека 87 евро / 170.16 лв. на вечер за бунгало<br></i>\n<br><b>Нереновирани бунгала:\n</b><br><i>до 3 човека 42 евро / 82.14 лв. на вечер за бунгало\n<br>за 4 човека 56 евро / 109.53 лв. на вечер за бунгало\n<br>за 5 човека 70 евро / 136.91 лв. на вечер за бунгало\n</i><br>\n<br>Сумата на депозита се връща при уведомяване най-малко от 20 дни преди началната дата на резервацията.<br>Настаняването в бунгалата става след 13 ч., а напускането до 10 ч.<br>\n<br><b><i>Банкови данни:</i></b><br>Арктик 96 ЕООД\n<br>Банка: УниКредит Булбанк АД\n<br>IBAN: BG60UNCR70001524956166\n<br>BIC KOD: UNCRBGSF\n<br><br><b>Телефон:</b> <b><i>+359 884 112 129</i></b><br>Адрес: гр. Ахтопол, ул. \"Витошка\", №3<br>Бунгала \"Южен бряг\"<br>Работно време: Всеки ден от май до октомври</p> \n\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n            <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n        <div class=\"google-map\" mbr-map=\"googleMap\">https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyCt1265A4qvZy9HKUeA8J15AOC4SrCyZe4&amp;q=%D0%B3%D1%80.%20%D0%90%D1%85%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
